    { "\"connecting\" forever, no matter what the game is doing.", "2af3ba3c", 103 },
    { "\"Copy map URL\", then paste it into your browser and bookmark it.", "5fb26ffe", 103 },
    { "(You can delete the stale index.html, map.js, forest.js, fv.js, symbols_icons.js", "4e3f4bef", 103 },
    { "and all the map geometry now ship inside the mod itself. Only the small live", "c699c7e6", 103 },
    { "and the fv/ folder in here; nothing uses them any more.)", "91ff5e73", 103 },
    { "Copies the URL above to your clipboard. Paste it into your browser (Ctrl+V) and bookmark the page.", "23114f00", 103 },
    { "files (your position, fog and notes) are still written here.", "36ad43d8", 103 },
    { "Game-side support info, for a bug report. For the browser side, press Shift+Z on the map page.", "d1a9e250", 103 },
    { "How often the map refreshes the player position + heading. LOWER = smoother", "cd559f8d", 103 },
    { "If your bookmark points at index.html in this folder it will sit on", "176db8e0", 103 },
    { "It used to be written to this folder as index.html, along with the map data.", "7737eaca", 103 },
    { "Project Zomboid 42.20 stopped letting mods write .html or .js files, so the page", "b3fecdcc", 103 },
    { "The current address for this install is:", "9bb798d6", 103, 105 },
    { "The PZ Map viewer page has MOVED.", "ebf1a987", 103 },
    { "To get the new address: in game, open Options -> Mods -> PZ Map and click", "8153ec9d", 103 },
    { "1. Copy the command below.", "254bcdc6", 104 },
    { "3. Quit the game (QUIT). The installer waits for that, then copies the files.", "4a8cb7a0", 104 },
    { "4. Start the game: Options now has an Optimizations tab.", "38d5319e", 104 },
    { "Copied", "a588b1ab", 104 },
    { "PZ Optimization is installed.\n\nThis Workshop mod only shows the install command,\nso you can disable it in the Mods list.", "a14c290d", 104 },
    { "PZ Optimization is not installed yet", "c378f291", 104 },
    { "The optimizations are class files for the game folder; Steam downloaded them with", "76c4953c", 104 },
    { "Then disable this mod in the Mods list: it only shows this window.", "c5add7fa", 104 },
    { "this item, and one command copies them in. The game does not load them from here.", "ffd2ad65", 104 },
    { "this item, and the installer in the item's folder copies them in.", "2a5267bd", 104 },
    { "This window could not find the item's folder; the Workshop page has the command:", "a90ed423", 104 },
    { "To uninstall later: Options > PZ Optimization > Uninstall PZ Optimization...", "5fbb0e76", 104 },
    { "\"Copy dashboard URL\", then paste it into your browser and bookmark it.", "3400b9f6", 105 },
    { "\"No heartbeat detected\" forever, no matter what the game is doing.", "4055ec2f", 105 },
    { "(You can delete the stale index.html in this folder; nothing uses it.)", "b665fc5c", 105 },
    { "Easiest way to find it: search your file manager for a folder named", "c1c8af29", 105 },
    { "How often the dashboard checks for changes. 250-500ms feels live; raise it", "b9f609d6", 105 },
    { "If your bookmark points at index.html in this folder it will just say", "fc904e14", 105 },
    { "It used to be written to this folder as index.html. Project Zomboid 42.20 stopped", "f24f19e2", 105 },
    { "letting mods write .html files, so the page now ships inside the mod instead, and", "c400ba56", 105 },
    { "only the live data is written here.", "1a24f681", 105 },
